# Miriam, Herd Whisperer: "Whenever a Mount or Vehicle you control attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it." (CR 508.3a, 603.2c,
# 122.1). On turn 3 Bot1's Memnite (summoning sick, which does not matter for a crew cost) crews Air Response Unit (a 3/3
# Vehicle); the Unit and Miriam (a Human Druid, neither Mount nor Vehicle) attack together: the Unit gets exactly one counter
# and hits for 4, Miriam gets none and hits for 3, so Bot2 is at 20 - 7 = 13.

